Description: TI EdgeAI Deep Learning Inferer library
 A Linux C++ library abstracting the Open Source Runtime (OSRT) APIs for
 DL inference. Supports TFLite and ONNX Runtime backends.
 .
 Provides Python bindings for the DL inferer (edgeai_dl_inferer.py).

